Código Civil 2005-2024, 22 versions: every version's wording is cut from the text layer of the Registro Oficial edition of the 2005 codification or of the amending act (no OCR, no consolidation text); no official consolidation exists, today's text agrees with the Ediciones Legales 2025 consolidation in 2,362 of 2,428 articles and every disagreement is explained in decisions; 9 acts whose gazette edition is image-only or unreachable are NOT applied and are marked in their commits and decisions; test build check.py 0 mismatches, --compare identical (2026-10-28).
